{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CultivationMagicWorld: AFK Loot Farm, Screen-Filling Sword Rain, Aerial Combat, Ascend to Tao Ancestor \u2013 Ultimate 3D Cultivation RPG!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D fixed-view single-player RPG blending idle loot farming with an epic cultivation progression system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tedious quests \u2013 <strong>log in and fight instantly, one-click AFK auto-farming</strong> for resources, and soar effortlessly through realms to transcendence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Classes:</strong> Sword Cultivator, Body Cultivator, Flame Mage, Ice Mage, Thunder Mage, Beast Tamer \u2013 each with unique playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerial Combat:</strong> Soar on sword flight, beast mounts, or pure qi flight \u2013 experience thrilling immortal battles in the skies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talent &amp; Physique Awakening:</strong> Unlock Ancient Sacred Body, Innate Dao Embryo \u2013 forge your own path to supreme power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Loot Drops:</strong> Defeat mobs, elites, and bosses for gear! Synthesize, upgrade, awaken item spirits \u2013 build an arsenal of legendary equipment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Beast Companions:</strong> Capture monsters as loyal allies \u2013 tanks, DPS, healers unleash devastating screen-wide sword storms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realm Progression:</strong> Body Tempering \u2192 Spirit Point Weaving \u2192 Spirit Point Refinement \u2192 Foundation Forge  \u2192 Sham Core \u2192 Core Formation  \u2192 Nascent Soul  \u2192 Spirit Ascend  \u2192 Body-Spirit Fuse  \u2192 Void Percept  \u2192 Tribulation  \u2192 Mahayana  \u2192 Immortal...\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Deity...  \u2192 Tao...  \u2192 Transcendence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AFK Freedom:</strong> One-click auto-farm for offline gains; switch to manual for intense boss battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Mods:</strong> Load community-created mods for entirely new experiences!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultivation Journey: From Mortal to Transcendence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the <strong>All-Heavens Cultivation System Spirit</strong>, begin as a mortal, endure cycles of rebirth and heavenly tribulations, conquer Immortal, Divine, and Tao Realms \u2013 finally achieve ultimate enlightenment: one thought becomes demon, one thought becomes Buddha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642180/extras/9b712514a1b714053ce4fc43d628fc92.avif?t=1768128351\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642180/extras_big/9b712514a1b714053ce4fc43d628fc92.avif?t=1768128351 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D <strong>Cultivation</strong> Adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhilarating Aerial Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep AFK Progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive Loot Grinding!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Collection System!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Player Mod Support!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist Now \u2013 One Thought to Ascend, Your Immortal Journey Awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refund Policy:</strong> Refundable within \u22642 hours of playtime \u2013 for safety, a